  "body": "See http://stackoverflow.com/questions/40432349/what-does-the-disown-opener-content-security-policy-do\r\n\r\nIf you’re a reader of the spec who isn’t already familiar with the intended purposes of `rel=opener` or “disowning” the opener of a browsing context—or of setting `window.opener` to `null`—the current spec sections defining those don’t give any clarity to you on what the beneficial effects might be.",
